WEBVTT

01:35.770 --> 01:40.860
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.590 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 5]

01:49.560 --> 01:51.000
Who in the royal family

01:51.200 --> 01:53.000
hasn't endured grievances?

01:55.229 --> 01:56.070
I know.

01:56.560 --> 01:58.090
This is my responsibility.

01:58.400 --> 01:59.930
Born into the royal family,

02:00.400 --> 02:00.950
everyone has their

02:00.950 --> 02:02.880
own responsibilities to fulfill.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.690
But I just want to live for myself once,

02:06.560 --> 02:07.820
even if it's only once.

02:11.080 --> 02:11.910
Brother!

02:14.400 --> 02:15.120
Brother!

02:17.000 --> 02:17.950
Slow down.

02:18.180 --> 02:19.470
You're running so fast.

02:19.470 --> 02:22.270
If the governess sees you,
she'll scold you again.

02:22.280 --> 02:22.950
Brother, why did you

02:22.950 --> 02:24.470
suddenly come to the palace today?

02:24.470 --> 02:26.470
Did you come specifically to see me?

02:30.320 --> 02:31.920
You seem troubled, Brother.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.400
I have something to tell you.

02:35.030 --> 02:35.430
I don't want you

02:35.430 --> 02:37.030
to hear it from someone else.

02:37.310 --> 02:38.230
What is it?

02:39.150 --> 02:41.630
Jinxiu has sent a letter
proposing a marriage alliance,

02:41.630 --> 02:44.290
seeking to form
such an alliance with our Susha.

02:45.520 --> 02:47.430
I'm here just to ease your worries.

02:47.430 --> 02:48.290
Don't worry.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.480
I will never

02:49.500 --> 02:50.560
let you marry into Jinxiu,

02:50.560 --> 02:51.930
to Xia Jingshi.

02:59.030 --> 03:00.430
The Prince of Zhennan

03:00.680 --> 03:02.350
and I are mortal foes.

03:02.560 --> 03:03.670
You're my sister.

03:04.030 --> 03:05.310
If you fell into his hands,

03:05.310 --> 03:07.240
you'd be doomed beyond salvation.

03:07.400 --> 03:08.800
I didn't argue with Father

03:08.800 --> 03:10.400
in the imperial court today.

03:10.800 --> 03:12.620
But I will definitely find a way.

03:12.960 --> 03:13.310
No matter

03:13.310 --> 03:14.390
what price I have to pay,

03:14.390 --> 03:15.850
even if it costs me my life,

03:16.070 --> 03:16.800
I will absolutely

03:16.800 --> 03:18.240
prevent this from happening.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.360
Brother, no.

03:19.430 --> 03:21.470
-Actually, I...
-Don't be afraid, Xiyang.

03:21.470 --> 03:22.990
I was just joking!

03:23.030 --> 03:24.760
I've got a knack for surviving.

03:24.960 --> 03:25.720
Anyway,

03:26.120 --> 03:27.800
no matter what anyone tells you,

03:27.800 --> 03:29.090
don't take it to heart.

03:29.280 --> 03:31.320
If anyone tries to persuade you,

03:31.440 --> 03:32.880
tell them to come to me.

03:34.360 --> 03:35.220
Remember,

03:35.560 --> 03:36.900
as long as I'm here,

03:37.079 --> 03:38.190
even Father

03:38.560 --> 03:39.950
cannot force you.

03:44.020 --> 03:44.820
Your Majesty,

03:45.190 --> 03:47.079
are you really planning to
marry Princess Xiyang

03:47.079 --> 03:48.000
into Jinxiu?

03:49.750 --> 03:51.240
In the First Prince's heart,

03:51.240 --> 03:52.170
Princess Xiyang

03:52.190 --> 03:53.470
is probably the only family he has

03:53.470 --> 03:54.410
in this world.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.870
The only family...

03:56.960 --> 03:58.420
Your Majesty, forgive me!

03:58.710 --> 04:01.470
Even you think he feels nothing for me

04:02.710 --> 04:04.030
but hatred?

04:07.120 --> 04:08.180
If that's the case,

04:09.280 --> 04:11.460
he must hold onto that hatred forever.

04:11.590 --> 04:13.600
Hatred keeps people resolute;

04:14.870 --> 04:17.470
it hones away the weakness
in one's character.

04:17.720 --> 04:19.980
Is this really necessary, Your Majesty?

04:20.000 --> 04:22.040
He must overcome this obstacle.

04:23.210 --> 04:25.340
Only then will he be deemed qualified.

04:27.420 --> 04:30.000
[Wutong Mansion]

04:31.750 --> 04:33.950
Your pulse is steady, nothing unusual.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.000
Strange.

04:40.560 --> 04:41.600
You were fine just now.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.260
Why did you suddenly pass out?

04:44.159 --> 04:46.000
I think it must be
the lingering aftereffect

04:46.000 --> 04:47.070
from hitting my head.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.330
It's nothing serious.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.360
Young Mistress Ling.

04:50.720 --> 04:53.250
There's something
I'd like to entrust to you.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.159
Go ahead.

04:54.510 --> 04:55.640
Take those kids away

04:55.680 --> 04:56.870
immediately.

05:00.160 --> 05:01.310
But they're determined

05:01.310 --> 05:02.630
to be acknowledged by you.

05:02.630 --> 05:04.390
I don't think they'll listen to me.

05:04.390 --> 05:05.720
Whether they listen to you or not,

05:05.720 --> 05:06.600
you must find a way

05:06.600 --> 05:07.600
to take them away.

05:08.360 --> 05:08.820
First off,

05:08.820 --> 05:10.240
I can't remember who they are right now.

05:10.240 --> 05:10.720
And even if they

05:10.720 --> 05:12.050
truly are my disciples,

05:12.390 --> 05:13.580
I am now in enemy territory,

05:13.580 --> 05:15.000
struggling to save myself.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.000
If they stay here,

05:16.750 --> 05:18.550
there's no way they'll survive.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.060
Do you understand?

05:25.190 --> 05:25.800
They came from

05:25.800 --> 05:27.200
Pingling City in Jinxiu.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.250
Should I send them back to Jinxiu,

05:29.270 --> 05:30.430
or take them to Zhengnian Villa

05:30.430 --> 05:31.480
and keep them with me?

05:31.480 --> 05:33.409
As long as it's safe, it'll be fine.

05:33.830 --> 05:35.600
Feng Suige isn't at the mansion today.

05:35.600 --> 05:37.200
Take them and leave quickly.

05:37.950 --> 05:38.700
Now?

05:38.800 --> 05:39.190
Yes,

05:39.310 --> 05:40.120
leave now.

05:41.360 --> 05:42.130
Then I'll have Eleven

05:42.130 --> 05:43.130
take them back,

05:43.240 --> 05:44.120
and I'll stay here with you.

05:44.120 --> 05:44.680
No.

05:46.040 --> 05:46.830
All right.

05:49.830 --> 05:53.300
[The Yujing City Streets, Susha Kingdom]

06:02.680 --> 06:03.160
Come.

06:05.000 --> 06:06.140
Come, Shunzi.

06:06.950 --> 06:07.910
Xueying.

06:08.070 --> 06:09.000
Aren't we supposed to go

06:09.000 --> 06:10.160
buy medicinal herbs for Master?

06:10.160 --> 06:10.680
Yes,

06:10.950 --> 06:12.070
but there are too many herbs.

06:12.070 --> 06:13.240
We'll need a carriage to carry them.

06:13.240 --> 06:13.960
Be good.

06:14.040 --> 06:15.170
Get in the carriage.

06:15.480 --> 06:15.950
Come.

06:18.270 --> 06:18.980
My Lady.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.820
Master.

06:57.270 --> 06:59.370
Don't abandon me.

06:59.430 --> 07:01.160
I'll be good.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.240
Master.

07:02.260 --> 07:04.300
Don't abandon me.

07:04.390 --> 07:06.410
-I'll be good.
-Nine.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.210
Don't worry.

07:07.430 --> 07:09.040
Master won't abandon us.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.360
Don't worry.

07:18.060 --> 07:20.210
But Master has forgotten us.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.950
Will she really...

07:23.520 --> 07:25.620
abandon us for good?

07:26.870 --> 07:28.830
Where should we go?

07:29.600 --> 07:31.680
We have no home anymore.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.220
No.

07:33.800 --> 07:35.830
Master won't abandon us.

07:36.040 --> 07:36.830
She won't.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.800
I haven't forgotten you,

07:41.510 --> 07:43.170
and I would never abandon you.

07:43.720 --> 07:45.350
Yet I find myself in peril,

07:45.470 --> 07:46.940
unable to acknowledge you

07:47.310 --> 07:48.800
or protect you from harm.

07:50.630 --> 07:52.159
Only by staying away from me

07:52.360 --> 07:54.620
can you avoid being harmed because of me.

07:55.659 --> 08:00.140
[Wutong Mansion]

07:57.830 --> 07:58.490
Move aside.

07:58.830 --> 07:59.360
Miss Yixiao,

07:59.360 --> 08:00.310
where are you going?

08:00.310 --> 08:01.800
Do I need to report to you?

08:02.480 --> 08:03.000
I don't mean to

08:03.000 --> 08:04.000
stand in your way.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.190
It's just that His Highness

08:05.190 --> 08:06.160
is not at the mansion now,

08:06.160 --> 08:06.950
and he never mentioned

08:06.950 --> 08:07.870
that you would leave.

08:07.870 --> 08:08.670
Miss, why don't you let me

08:08.670 --> 08:09.600
accompany you for protection?

08:09.600 --> 08:10.890
I don't need your protection.

08:10.890 --> 08:13.030
[Wutong Mansion]

08:12.070 --> 08:13.000
Don't follow me.

08:28.710 --> 08:31.280
[Nansheng Gate]

08:33.600 --> 08:35.030
This is the road out of the city.

08:35.030 --> 08:35.720
Sister,

08:35.750 --> 08:36.549
didn't you say

08:36.549 --> 08:38.510
we were going to buy
medicinal herbs for Master?

08:38.510 --> 08:40.049
You... lied to us.

08:40.080 --> 08:40.960
I didn't.

08:41.390 --> 08:41.669
I...

08:41.669 --> 08:43.130
Where are you taking us?

08:43.240 --> 08:43.840
Yes.

08:47.400 --> 08:48.730
I'll be honest with you.

08:48.750 --> 08:49.320
It was your master who

08:49.320 --> 08:50.910
asked me to take you out of the city.

08:50.910 --> 08:51.790
She's in danger

08:51.810 --> 08:53.120
and can't take care of you.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.810
Be good.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.550
Will you come back to
Zhengnian Villa with me?

08:55.550 --> 08:56.990
If Master is in danger,

08:57.120 --> 08:58.250
why should we leave?

08:58.650 --> 08:59.680
I want to get off.

09:00.960 --> 09:02.330
Why are you being so disobedient?

09:02.330 --> 09:03.200
If you stay here,

09:03.200 --> 09:03.960
you'll only make your master

09:03.960 --> 09:04.790
worry more.

09:04.870 --> 09:05.360
If someone

09:05.360 --> 09:06.080
uses your lives

09:06.080 --> 09:07.000
to threaten your master...

09:07.000 --> 09:08.330
-Then she...
-Let's go.

09:08.440 --> 09:08.960
Fang!

09:10.320 --> 09:10.870
Fang!

09:11.720 --> 09:12.850
Where are you going?

09:12.870 --> 09:13.470
Shunzi!

09:13.550 --> 09:14.680
Don't run!

09:14.870 --> 09:15.270
Shunzi!

09:15.270 --> 09:16.360
Brother! Sister!

09:16.360 --> 09:17.160
-Stop!
-Fang!

09:17.270 --> 09:18.330
-Stop!
-Don't run!

09:18.480 --> 09:19.120
Brother!

09:19.150 --> 09:19.910
Sister!

09:19.910 --> 09:21.320
Eleven, watch over Nine.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.690
-I'll go after them.
-Sister, wait for me!

09:24.480 --> 09:25.600
-Shunzi!
-Brother!

09:25.600 --> 09:26.660
-Sister!
-Shunzi!

09:34.110 --> 09:34.970
Your Highness,

09:35.240 --> 09:36.640
you've finally come out.

09:36.670 --> 09:37.360
Yun Fang

09:37.360 --> 09:38.240
nearly drove me crazy.

09:38.240 --> 09:41.040
He insisted on returning to camp
to reorganize the troops,

09:41.040 --> 09:42.910
and bringing the Feng Battalion
into the city.

09:42.910 --> 09:44.170
What is he trying to do?

09:44.240 --> 09:45.150
Stage a rebellion?

09:45.150 --> 09:46.320
Well, I talked to him.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.890
We only stopped him after discussion.

09:47.890 --> 09:48.890
That brat.

09:49.270 --> 09:51.070
Are you alright, Your Highness?

09:51.390 --> 09:52.360
What's His Majesty's

09:52.360 --> 09:53.840
attitude toward the marriage alliance?

09:53.840 --> 09:55.170
Whatever his attitude,

09:55.270 --> 09:56.600
it won't happen anyway.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.810
You have a plan already?

10:00.960 --> 10:02.820
The undercover guards of Jinxiu
attacked Yujing

10:02.820 --> 10:04.510
and severely wounded
the First Prince of Susha.

10:04.510 --> 10:05.480
The two states had just ended the war,

10:05.480 --> 10:06.860
and such a thing happened.

10:06.860 --> 10:08.320
Besides, it was the fault of Jinxiu.

10:08.320 --> 10:11.000
I'm sure they wouldn't dare
to go to war because of this.

10:11.000 --> 10:12.270
Brilliant, Your Highness!

10:12.270 --> 10:13.960
You had us all so worried.

10:13.960 --> 10:15.030
We were so worried.

10:15.360 --> 10:17.220
I thought of it on the way just now.

10:17.790 --> 10:18.520
Impressive.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.200
It's impressive.

10:20.840 --> 10:21.700
Your Highness,

10:22.390 --> 10:23.720
something's happened.

10:41.760 --> 10:43.040
Excuse me.

10:49.910 --> 10:50.700
I'm sorry.

11:01.000 --> 11:02.200
Master!

11:15.240 --> 11:17.000
Master, please don't abandon me.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.990
I'll do anything you ask.

11:19.030 --> 11:21.120
Don't abandon me.

11:21.720 --> 11:23.150
I'll be good.

11:24.510 --> 11:25.960
Who told you to run off like that?

11:25.960 --> 11:26.790
Running around like this is dangerous.

11:26.790 --> 11:27.850
Do you understand?

11:28.030 --> 11:28.480
Didn't I tell you

11:28.480 --> 11:29.390
to listen to Xueying?

11:29.390 --> 11:30.240
Why are you being so disobedient?

11:30.240 --> 11:31.370
What if you got lost?

11:31.390 --> 11:33.050
Are you asking for a spanking?

11:33.240 --> 11:33.750
I...

11:34.000 --> 11:37.150
Please don't abandon us.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.720
I'm not abandoning you.

11:42.270 --> 11:43.150
I want you

11:43.150 --> 11:44.080
to leave Yujing City,

11:44.080 --> 11:45.510
and keep yourselves safe,

11:45.510 --> 11:46.240
understand?

11:52.360 --> 11:53.120
Yixiao!

11:54.440 --> 11:55.120
Yixiao!

11:57.240 --> 11:58.440
These kids...

11:58.600 --> 12:00.000
They're so disobedient.

12:00.120 --> 12:02.180
I almost couldn't catch up with them.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.560
-Master!
-Slow down!

12:05.120 --> 12:06.850
Why are you running around too?

12:06.870 --> 12:08.670
You're all giving me headaches.

12:11.440 --> 12:12.300
Where's Fang?

12:12.720 --> 12:14.080
He's run off in that direction!

12:14.080 --> 12:15.840
Fang went in another direction.

12:15.840 --> 12:17.240
They ran off separately.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.200
These two kids

12:18.270 --> 12:19.720
have had me running ragged!

12:19.720 --> 12:21.120
Yixiao, don't worry.

12:21.150 --> 12:22.410
I'll go after Fang now.

12:22.550 --> 12:23.480
I'll go find him.

12:24.120 --> 12:25.000
You keep an eye on

12:25.000 --> 12:25.860
these two kids.

12:26.600 --> 12:27.730
No more running off!

12:40.720 --> 12:41.480
Fang!

12:47.120 --> 12:47.750
Fang!

13:01.240 --> 13:03.040
Merchant ships on the Wei River.

13:11.630 --> 13:12.270
Fang!

13:14.050 --> 13:14.980
Fang!

13:20.390 --> 13:21.760
You're Fang, right?

13:22.040 --> 13:23.500
Your full name is Qin Fang.

13:23.840 --> 13:25.550
Your father was once my squad leader.

13:25.550 --> 13:27.270
It's alright. Don't be afraid.

13:27.270 --> 13:28.320
As long as you behave,

13:28.320 --> 13:29.470
I won't hurt you.

13:30.080 --> 13:30.840
Alright.

13:31.150 --> 13:32.550
The time has finally come.

13:32.550 --> 13:33.680
We can make our move.

13:58.340 --> 13:59.350
Boatman, hurry!

14:26.270 --> 14:27.240
Master!

14:27.480 --> 14:28.390
Master!

14:35.390 --> 14:36.310
Master!

14:37.320 --> 14:39.180
They know this kid is my weakness.

14:39.530 --> 14:41.260
It seems that they know me well.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.350
You are from the Jinxiu Army.

14:49.630 --> 14:50.440
Master!

14:53.070 --> 14:54.730
What's wrong, Commander Fu?

14:55.270 --> 14:56.080
Don't tell me

14:56.360 --> 14:57.890
you don't even remember me?

14:58.130 --> 15:00.000
I've followed you for many years.

15:00.910 --> 15:02.520
I was even your guard.

15:03.670 --> 15:05.650
She fell from such a high cliff.

15:05.750 --> 15:07.610
Could she have damaged her brain?

15:09.150 --> 15:10.360
Who wants to kill me?

15:10.750 --> 15:12.480
Once you reach the underworld,

15:14.860 --> 15:16.390
someone will tell you.

15:18.790 --> 15:19.270
Move!

15:50.640 --> 15:51.490
Master!

16:15.380 --> 16:16.310
-Master.
-Fang.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.330
Are you okay?

16:18.000 --> 16:18.850
Master!

16:40.910 --> 16:41.630
Master!

16:41.790 --> 16:42.360
Master!

16:42.440 --> 16:43.480
Master!

16:44.510 --> 16:45.420
Master!

16:45.630 --> 16:46.150
Fang!

16:57.440 --> 16:58.500
Put down the knife,

16:58.510 --> 16:59.710
or I'll kill him!

16:59.870 --> 17:00.770
Master!

17:00.870 --> 17:02.050
Don't worry about me!

17:02.050 --> 17:02.800
Shut up!

17:05.480 --> 17:06.270
Put it down!

17:22.550 --> 17:24.200
Master, no!

17:31.000 --> 17:32.590
Master!

17:42.960 --> 17:44.240
Master!

17:46.640 --> 17:48.640
Master!

17:49.350 --> 17:51.140
Master!

18:08.440 --> 18:10.030
Master!

18:17.270 --> 18:19.960
Master!

18:40.880 --> 18:43.340
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

18:43.990 --> 18:47.720
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

18:46.110 --> 18:47.420
Feng Suige.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.720
♪ The light between your brows ♪

18:50.080 --> 18:51.760
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

18:52.050 --> 18:54.480
♪ That I love the most ♪

18:55.640 --> 18:57.750
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

18:56.720 --> 18:58.370
Leave one alive.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.400
Understood.

18:58.950 --> 19:02.230
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

19:02.990 --> 19:04.490
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

19:05.170 --> 19:09.170
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

19:10.560 --> 19:13.430
♪ Not in vain ♪

19:38.070 --> 19:38.590
Fang!

19:38.790 --> 19:39.480
Master!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.000
Master!

20:23.110 --> 20:23.720
Fang!

20:24.200 --> 20:24.950
Fang!

20:25.560 --> 20:26.160
Fu Yixiao!

20:26.630 --> 20:27.260
Fu Yixiao!

20:29.240 --> 20:30.870
This ship is soaked with oil.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.560
If you stay, you'll only die.

20:32.720 --> 20:33.550
Let me go!

20:33.750 --> 20:34.950
Fu Yixiao, look at me!

20:35.110 --> 20:35.760
Fu Yixiao!

20:35.790 --> 20:37.200
If you rush in recklessly

20:37.200 --> 20:38.160
and lose your life,

20:38.160 --> 20:40.090
how will you ever get your revenge?

20:42.440 --> 20:43.260
Move!

20:43.370 --> 20:44.860
I said move!

20:45.350 --> 20:46.030
Let go!

20:46.640 --> 20:47.590
Let go of me!

20:50.920 --> 20:51.480
Fine!

20:51.510 --> 20:52.310
I'll help you!

21:24.030 --> 21:25.290
All of you, go quickly!

21:26.200 --> 21:28.060
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

21:37.590 --> 21:39.450
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

21:43.440 --> 21:44.300
Your Highness!

21:44.400 --> 21:46.000
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

21:46.000 --> 21:46.860
Your Highness!

21:50.480 --> 21:51.030
Fang!

21:56.400 --> 21:57.310
Feng Suige.

21:57.720 --> 21:58.780
Where is Fu Yixiao?

22:04.650 --> 22:05.580
Don't be afraid.

22:05.750 --> 22:06.640
Do you have the gift

22:06.640 --> 22:07.270
I gave you?

22:11.240 --> 22:11.980
Do it now!

22:43.240 --> 22:44.510
Your Highness!

23:43.830 --> 23:44.410
Fang.

23:44.680 --> 23:45.240
Get in.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.100
Hold onto the box tightly.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.590
Come out when there's no water.

23:48.590 --> 23:49.320
Understand?

24:31.110 --> 24:32.090
Master!

24:32.350 --> 24:33.870
Master, I'm here!

24:33.890 --> 24:34.480
Fang!

24:40.160 --> 24:40.960
Master!

24:41.440 --> 24:42.110
Fang!

24:55.640 --> 24:56.550
Are you alright?

24:56.550 --> 24:57.400
Where is Feng Suige?

24:57.400 --> 24:58.750
He's still in the cabin.

25:12.000 --> 25:12.550
Lie down.

27:06.160 --> 27:07.050
Let me out!

27:07.200 --> 27:07.980
His Highness has ordered

27:07.980 --> 27:09.350
that you cannot step outside the mansion.

27:09.350 --> 27:09.830
I am not

27:09.830 --> 27:10.880
a prisoner in your mansion.

27:10.880 --> 27:12.310
What right do you have to confine me?

27:12.310 --> 27:12.920
Let me out!

27:12.940 --> 27:14.000
I need to find Fang.

27:14.070 --> 27:15.530
Why don't you listen to me?

27:15.960 --> 27:17.020
What are you doing?

27:17.070 --> 27:18.800
Who told you to lay hands on her?

27:19.510 --> 27:20.510
It's all my fault.

27:22.880 --> 27:23.880
It's all my fault.

27:24.310 --> 27:24.960
My Lady.

27:25.480 --> 27:27.310
Fang will be fine.

28:08.590 --> 28:11.620
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

28:12.310 --> 28:15.500
♪ Fold the heavens and earth
to make my wings ♪

28:16.000 --> 28:16.920
Master.

28:16.320 --> 28:17.470
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

28:17.160 --> 28:18.510
I'm sleepy.

28:18.150 --> 28:21.330
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

28:19.590 --> 28:21.350
You were scared today, weren't you?

28:21.350 --> 28:21.950
It's okay.

28:22.480 --> 28:23.540
I'll hold you.

28:23.590 --> 28:24.390
Just sleep soundly.

28:23.650 --> 28:26.540
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

28:25.350 --> 28:26.490
Master,

28:26.550 --> 28:28.750
can you sing for me?

28:27.260 --> 28:30.010
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

28:30.400 --> 28:31.420
In the past,

28:30.620 --> 28:33.230
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

28:31.510 --> 28:34.110
you would always sing
to help us fall asleep.

28:33.980 --> 28:36.450
♪ My eyes ♪

28:36.270 --> 28:37.960
But I don't remember anymore.

28:37.010 --> 28:38.430
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

28:38.270 --> 28:39.160
It's alright.

28:39.030 --> 28:40.620
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

28:39.350 --> 28:40.350
I can teach you.

28:41.270 --> 28:41.750
Okay.

28:41.660 --> 28:43.850
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

28:44.330 --> 28:45.680
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

28:46.250 --> 28:48.770
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

28:49.290 --> 28:51.180
♪ Thinking of you day and night ♪

28:52.370 --> 28:54.790
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

28:55.350 --> 28:59.230
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

28:59.790 --> 29:01.110
♪ The light between your brows ♪

29:01.500 --> 29:03.210
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

29:03.540 --> 29:06.050
♪ That I love the most ♪

29:07.290 --> 29:09.040
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

29:10.180 --> 29:13.760
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

29:14.210 --> 29:15.960
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

29:16.560 --> 29:20.840
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

29:21.780 --> 29:25.000
♪ Not in vain ♪

29:26.680 --> 29:28.650
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

29:29.830 --> 29:32.910
♪ Fold the heavens and earth
to make my wings ♪

29:33.760 --> 29:34.930
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

29:35.670 --> 29:38.850
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

29:39.680 --> 29:40.620
I never thought

29:40.750 --> 29:42.200
you would risk your life

29:42.220 --> 29:43.620
to save Fang.

29:44.720 --> 29:45.850
Thank you for today.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.720
Rather than thanking me,

29:56.720 --> 29:57.270
you should be

29:57.270 --> 29:58.520
apologizing to me.

29:58.790 --> 29:59.720
What do you mean?

30:01.520 --> 30:03.320
When I was unconscious just now,

30:04.000 --> 30:05.030
what did you do?

30:05.920 --> 30:06.720
To save you,

30:06.720 --> 30:08.650
I pounded on your chest a few times.

30:08.720 --> 30:09.310
What?

30:09.590 --> 30:10.990
Are you holding a grudge?

30:11.750 --> 30:13.390
How can you forget

30:13.640 --> 30:15.370
what just happened so quickly?

30:15.960 --> 30:17.560
Why don't you remind me then?

30:18.510 --> 30:19.070
I mean...

30:25.100 --> 30:26.990
What more do you need me to say?

30:27.270 --> 30:28.240
Are all women from Jinxiu

30:28.240 --> 30:29.580
as bold as

30:29.830 --> 30:30.880
you are?

30:32.110 --> 30:33.030
Oh, you're talking about that little thing

30:33.030 --> 30:34.110
with the blowing?

30:36.220 --> 30:37.910
How did you feel about it?

30:47.720 --> 30:50.750
Did you just ask me how I felt?

30:55.030 --> 30:55.880
I've always known

30:55.880 --> 30:57.270
you're not an ordinary woman

30:57.270 --> 30:58.400
and you don't care much

30:58.400 --> 30:59.270
about gender boundaries.

30:59.270 --> 31:01.130
But I didn't expect you to be so...

31:01.790 --> 31:02.400
So...

31:03.030 --> 31:03.790
So what?

31:08.240 --> 31:08.900
Never mind.

31:09.350 --> 31:09.960
Considering you did it

31:09.960 --> 31:11.240
to save me,

31:11.350 --> 31:12.880
I won't hold it against you.

31:12.960 --> 31:14.030
But you are not allowed

31:14.030 --> 31:15.760
to mention this to anyone else.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.320
I can keep quiet about it,

31:17.750 --> 31:18.720
but I think

31:18.720 --> 31:20.310
you should ask Fang about it.

31:20.310 --> 31:21.640
After all, it wasn't me who blew on you

31:21.640 --> 31:22.200
just now.

31:22.510 --> 31:23.310
It was him.

31:30.510 --> 31:31.920
Master, let me do it.

31:47.640 --> 31:49.440
Stop laughing and put your shoes back on.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.510
Look at you!

31:51.000 --> 31:53.000
Wet shoes make feet uncomfortable.

31:53.070 --> 31:54.720
It's much more comfortable barefoot.

31:54.720 --> 31:55.920
You should take your shoes off too.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.720
Take them off.

31:56.880 --> 31:58.410
Alright. I can do it myself.

32:00.160 --> 32:00.960
Go ahead then.

32:01.720 --> 32:03.120
You just fell into water,

32:03.270 --> 32:03.680
yet you're acting like

32:03.680 --> 32:05.070
a sulking housewife.

32:07.110 --> 32:07.680
However,

32:08.310 --> 32:10.310
it's quite rare to see you like this.

32:13.270 --> 32:14.550
I'm indebted to you

32:14.640 --> 32:15.570
for saving Fang.

32:16.310 --> 32:17.750
No matter what happens in the future,

32:17.750 --> 32:19.000
when you ask me to repay it,

32:19.000 --> 32:20.750
even if it means
going through fire and water,

32:20.750 --> 32:22.280
I will certainly repay you.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.530
Zhuang He just passed away.

32:35.750 --> 32:37.880
Do you want to follow in his footsteps?

32:41.920 --> 32:43.270
I know what you're thinking.

32:43.270 --> 32:45.590
You want to use someone from Jinxiu

32:45.640 --> 32:47.040
to eliminate Feng Suige.

32:47.510 --> 32:49.050
Do you think you can hide it?

32:49.620 --> 32:51.050
This is Yujing City.

32:51.640 --> 32:52.550
Whatever you do,

32:52.550 --> 32:54.680
do you think Feng Suige won't find out?

32:54.960 --> 32:56.320
I'm sorry.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.970
I was wrong.

32:58.200 --> 32:58.880
I have always been

32:58.880 --> 32:59.830
completely loyal to you, Uncle,

32:59.830 --> 33:01.880
and never had
any thoughts of disobedience.

33:01.880 --> 33:03.200
I just want to help you

33:03.200 --> 33:04.310
solve your problems.

33:04.310 --> 33:05.000
Listen,

33:06.310 --> 33:07.680
I have my own plans.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.510
Whoever dares to ruin my plans

33:09.510 --> 33:10.570
will die by my hand!

33:14.440 --> 33:16.370
Before Feng Suige tracks you down,

33:16.510 --> 33:18.370
get out of here and hide yourself.

33:18.550 --> 33:19.240
Uncle.

33:20.700 --> 33:22.310
When can I return?

33:24.090 --> 33:25.670
When I need you,

33:26.400 --> 33:27.540
I'll send for you.

33:48.720 --> 33:49.580
Your Highness.

33:49.590 --> 33:51.240
The imperial decree was issued days ago.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.240
The marriage alliance
cannot be delayed any longer.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.950
We must set a wedding date soon.

33:54.950 --> 33:56.360
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

33:55.440 --> 33:56.520
We haven't even found Yixiao yet.

33:56.520 --> 33:58.440
How could His Highness be in the mood
for the marriage alliance?

33:58.440 --> 33:59.240
I will keep sending people

33:59.240 --> 34:00.350
to look for Yixiao.

34:00.830 --> 34:02.750
But this marriage alliance
is a major affair.

34:02.750 --> 34:04.010
If we delay any longer,

34:04.160 --> 34:05.510
and the Emperor blames us,

34:05.510 --> 34:05.960
we'll be...

34:05.960 --> 34:06.760
We'll be what?

34:07.270 --> 34:08.280
Would they really charge His Highness

34:08.280 --> 34:09.760
with defying imperial orders?

34:09.760 --> 34:11.110
The one who guards the border for Jinxiu

34:11.110 --> 34:12.000
is His Highness.

34:12.000 --> 34:13.230
The one who safeguards
the Emperor's security

34:13.230 --> 34:14.429
is also His Highness.

34:14.710 --> 34:16.630
But how does the Emperor
treat His Highness?

34:16.630 --> 34:17.670
Withholding our military pay,

34:17.670 --> 34:20.130
suppressing our military achievements...

34:23.540 --> 34:26.469
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

34:24.230 --> 34:25.090
Your Highness!

34:25.880 --> 34:26.670
Your Highness!

34:26.670 --> 34:27.600
Commander Fu...

34:27.760 --> 34:29.360
Commander Fu is still alive.

34:29.630 --> 34:30.560
We've found her.

34:34.510 --> 34:35.510
You've found her?

34:36.110 --> 34:37.170
What did you say?

34:37.400 --> 34:38.510
Where did you find her?

34:38.510 --> 34:39.250
Tell me.

34:39.400 --> 34:41.190
According to our wounded soldier,

34:41.190 --> 34:42.550
the Young Mistress of Zhengnian Villa

34:42.550 --> 34:43.870
saved a woman in red,

34:43.900 --> 34:45.100
who was Commander Fu.

34:46.030 --> 34:47.690
And Commander Fu was captured

34:47.710 --> 34:49.170
by Feng Suige in the villa.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.449
We also learned that

34:50.710 --> 34:52.550
she was taken to Susha by Feng Suige,

34:52.550 --> 34:54.030
and is now in Yujing City.

34:54.630 --> 34:55.670
But we already went to Zhengnian Villa

34:55.670 --> 34:56.530
to look for her.

34:59.030 --> 35:00.760
She must have been hidden then.

35:02.150 --> 35:02.950
That's great.

35:03.280 --> 35:04.540
Yixiao is still alive.

35:04.670 --> 35:06.730
I told you she couldn't possibly die.

35:08.710 --> 35:09.670
Your Highness,

35:09.800 --> 35:11.030
please let me go to Yujing to save her!

35:11.030 --> 35:12.070
I'll even lay down my life

35:12.070 --> 35:13.210
to get Yixiao back!

35:13.760 --> 35:14.400
How?

35:14.800 --> 35:15.990
Will you go alone,

35:16.440 --> 35:18.170
or take our brothers-in-arms?

35:18.230 --> 35:19.550
-I...
-How many people?

35:19.550 --> 35:20.710
Open confrontation or stealth?

35:20.710 --> 35:22.440
What are your chances of success?

35:22.440 --> 35:23.840
And you'll even lay down your life?

35:23.840 --> 35:25.280
Does His Highness
not care about your life?

35:25.280 --> 35:26.670
I just want to save Yixiao!

35:26.670 --> 35:27.320
Enough!

35:28.760 --> 35:29.320
Weiran.

35:30.150 --> 35:31.620
Send someone to inform His Majesty

35:31.620 --> 35:34.930
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

35:31.710 --> 35:33.590
that I will depart for Yujing immediately,

35:33.590 --> 35:35.360
and we'll discuss
the wedding date after I arrive.

35:35.360 --> 35:36.030
Your Highness,

35:36.030 --> 35:36.760
I'm afraid it's inappropriate...

35:36.760 --> 35:37.320
Go now!

35:38.320 --> 35:39.510
Yixiao is in Feng Suige's hands.

35:39.510 --> 35:41.440
No one knows
how much suffering she has endured.

35:41.440 --> 35:42.230
Her life could be in danger

35:42.230 --> 35:43.150
at any moment.

35:44.030 --> 35:45.670
Now I'm the only one who can save her.

35:45.670 --> 35:47.400
We can't waste a single moment.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.480
Prepare the horses,

35:48.480 --> 35:49.670
travel light,

35:51.190 --> 35:52.070
we'll leave immediately.

35:52.070 --> 35:52.590
Yes.

35:54.440 --> 35:55.800
His Highness will be fine.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.210
He will be safe.

35:57.480 --> 35:59.070
Let's search downstream
along the riverbank.

35:59.070 --> 36:00.190
We must find His Highness.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.050
Your Highness!

36:01.360 --> 36:02.220
Your Highness!

36:03.110 --> 36:04.010
Your Highness!

36:04.040 --> 36:05.080
Your Highness!

36:05.110 --> 36:05.970
Your Highness!

36:06.110 --> 36:07.150
Your Highness!

36:07.880 --> 36:08.570
Yun Fang.

36:08.760 --> 36:09.880
Take some men to search the east bank.

36:09.880 --> 36:10.670
I'll check ahead.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.030
Okay.

36:11.030 --> 36:11.630
Wait!

36:12.440 --> 36:13.030
Stop!

36:15.630 --> 36:16.190
Listen.

36:30.230 --> 36:32.070
It's His Highness's secret signal.

36:32.070 --> 36:34.330
-Hurry! Go that way! Hurry!
-Over there.

36:42.550 --> 36:44.410
Will this really summon your men?

36:44.840 --> 36:45.510
My men should be

36:45.510 --> 36:46.590
searching along the river

36:46.590 --> 36:47.440
for any trace of me right now.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.030
Your Highness!

36:48.030 --> 36:49.760
They shouldn't be too far away.

36:50.230 --> 36:50.960
That's true.

36:51.150 --> 36:52.820
You're the First Prince after all.

36:52.820 --> 36:53.960
They need to see you alive

36:53.960 --> 36:54.880
or your body.

37:02.070 --> 37:02.640
What?

37:02.760 --> 37:04.490
Are you afraid I'll poison you?

37:04.550 --> 37:05.190
But

37:05.920 --> 37:06.510
this really is

37:06.510 --> 37:08.040
a perfect place for murder.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.150
Three taps followed by
a pause of one breath,

37:29.150 --> 37:30.590
four taps followed by
a pause of three breaths,

37:30.590 --> 37:32.110
two taps followed by
a pause of two breaths,

37:32.110 --> 37:33.510
repeat this cycle twice,

37:33.760 --> 37:35.560
then reverse the sequence once.

37:35.670 --> 37:36.630
That's your military's

37:36.630 --> 37:38.160
distress signal, isn't it?

37:39.030 --> 37:40.330
Knowing it won't help.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.630
This secret signal

37:41.630 --> 37:43.160
changes every half a month.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.290
It's fine.

37:44.670 --> 37:45.760
Just tell me the new one

37:45.760 --> 37:46.840
once it's updated.

37:48.550 --> 37:49.150
Sure.

37:50.280 --> 37:50.880
Really?

37:52.510 --> 37:53.370
I dare to say it,

37:53.960 --> 37:55.560
but do you dare to believe it?

37:55.630 --> 37:57.560
Guess whether I believe you or not?

38:00.070 --> 38:02.630
You said you wanted to repay my favor,

38:03.230 --> 38:04.670
and now I've suddenly thought of

38:04.670 --> 38:05.800
a way to repay it.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.710
Isn't that a bit too hasty?

38:07.710 --> 38:09.000
It was you who just swore

38:09.000 --> 38:10.480
and talked big

38:10.550 --> 38:11.750
over there yourself.

38:12.030 --> 38:13.030
To me it sounds like

38:13.030 --> 38:15.070
you're already preparing to back out.

38:15.070 --> 38:16.760
I, Fu Yixiao, always keep my word.

38:16.760 --> 38:18.690
If I can't deliver, you can kill me.

38:18.800 --> 38:19.710
Don't worry.

38:20.110 --> 38:21.630
It's easy to repay my favor.

38:21.630 --> 38:23.430
It's just a piece of cake for you.

38:24.280 --> 38:26.360
It seems you've long had this planned out.

38:26.360 --> 38:27.920
No wonder you're the First Prince.

38:27.920 --> 38:29.510
You have an ulterior motive
for everything,

38:29.510 --> 38:31.510
and you'll never make a losing deal.

38:41.960 --> 38:42.800
Just tell me.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.960
Why are you getting so close?

38:45.800 --> 38:47.280
This is a secret.

38:57.590 --> 38:58.720
I was being foolish.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.150
There's no one else here.

39:01.400 --> 39:02.960
We don't need to whisper.

39:15.710 --> 39:16.740
Your Highness!

39:16.770 --> 39:17.780
Your Highness!

39:17.800 --> 39:19.150
Your Highness!

39:19.280 --> 39:20.200
Your Highness!

39:20.220 --> 39:22.430
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

39:22.460 --> 39:23.550
Your Highness!

39:24.440 --> 39:26.740
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

39:26.770 --> 39:27.630
Your Highness!

39:28.550 --> 39:29.590
Your Highness!

39:30.800 --> 39:31.840
Your Highness!

39:33.510 --> 39:34.550
Your Highness!

39:35.150 --> 39:35.920
We can go now.

40:08.960 --> 40:11.420
How dare you fall asleep
right under my nose?

40:11.480 --> 40:13.880
Aren't you afraid I'll harm you?

40:18.440 --> 40:18.920
What?

40:18.990 --> 40:19.930
How much longer?

40:20.110 --> 40:20.970
Your Highness.

40:28.250 --> 40:29.670
We're about to enter the city.

40:29.670 --> 40:32.130
We'll be back at the mansion
in just a moment.

40:33.920 --> 40:35.780
Tell Gu Yu and Yun Fang to go ahead.

40:36.110 --> 40:37.800
We'll circle the city a couple more times.

40:37.800 --> 40:38.800
No rush to return.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.440
Yes.

40:52.320 --> 40:52.960
Fine,

40:53.230 --> 40:54.920
I'll let you rest a little longer,

40:54.920 --> 40:56.450
but don't make this a habit.

41:08.550 --> 41:09.750
How did I fall asleep?

41:14.800 --> 41:15.590
Feng Suige,

41:16.220 --> 41:17.740
why did you save Fang?

41:18.760 --> 41:20.760
Aren't you supposed to be ruthless?

41:21.320 --> 41:22.230
Why would you risk your life

41:22.230 --> 41:23.360
to save a child

41:23.360 --> 41:24.760
who means nothing to you?

41:27.920 --> 41:29.590
Are you good or evil?

41:30.840 --> 41:32.770
I find you more puzzling by the day.

41:38.510 --> 41:40.240
We've arrived, Your Highness.

41:44.400 --> 41:45.260
We've arrived.

41:48.510 --> 41:49.440
You fell asleep.

41:49.760 --> 41:50.490
Impossible.

41:51.320 --> 41:52.480
With strangers around,

41:52.480 --> 41:54.230
I could never fall asleep.

41:58.150 --> 41:58.880
I was merely

41:58.920 --> 42:00.150
resting my eyes.

42:03.280 --> 42:05.510
Master, where are we?

42:06.320 --> 42:08.230
It's alright now. We're safe.

42:08.450 --> 42:08.980
Let's go.

42:24.470 --> 42:26.560
She feels safe with me?

42:34.710 --> 42:35.510
Brother.

42:38.230 --> 42:39.560
Thank you for saving me.

42:40.000 --> 42:41.070
Don't mention it.

42:41.330 --> 42:42.410
Didn't I tell you?

42:42.590 --> 42:43.910
We're friends.

42:44.190 --> 42:45.000
You're the first friend

42:45.000 --> 42:46.150
I've made here,

42:46.710 --> 42:47.590
and in the future,

42:47.590 --> 42:49.320
if there's anything I can do for you,

42:49.320 --> 42:50.630
I'll definitely help.

42:55.150 --> 42:55.900
Great.

42:56.360 --> 42:57.750
If I need anything,

42:57.880 --> 42:59.120
I won't hesitate to ask.
